<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Egypt wheat buy sourcing unconfirmed - AWB.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Egypt wheat buy sourcing unconfirmed - AWB.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The sourcing had not yet been confirmed for Egypt's purchase of 110,000 tonnes of U.S. or Australian wheat for June delivery, a spokeswoman for the Australian Wheat Board said on Friday.</p>
<p>Cairo trade sources said on Thursday that Egypt bought 110,000 tonnes of wheat at about US$167.00 a tonne C+F and one trader said it would almost certainly be of U.S. origin.</p>
<p>Sourcing of the wheat in the deal remained to be settled by traders, Australian wheat industry sources said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
